  The signed examples of the did:cid Method Specification,
  https://github.com/archetech/didcid-specs commit
  e8aace4d79542aed0ea58b4e252f260f176a70e3: the first two JSON blocks of
  markdown/creation.md (agent, asset), the first of markdown/update.md
